05310101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30380,"speakerName":"Onnea","textMapHash":1311529802,"text":"Please wait! Are you also here for the King of Invokations Grand Prix?","nextNodeIds":[705310102]},{"nodeId":705310102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30380,"speakerName":"Onnea","textMapHash":4266544530,"text":"If you have a minute, I'd like to tell you a little about this event hosted by the Adventurers' Guild called \"A Tour of Wonders.\"","nextNodeIds":[705310103,705310104]},{"nodeId":705310103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1743417682,"text":"Um... sure?","nextNodeIds":[705310105]},{"nodeId":705310105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30380,"speakerName":"Onnea","textMapHash":3794952722,"text":"Thank you! Then I'll go ahead and introduce the basics of this event.","nextNodeIds":[705310106]},{"nodeId":705310106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30380,"speakerName":"Onnea","textMapHash":2669842786,"text":"Simply put, the Adventurers' Guild has placed multiple Scenic Checkpoints in various locations across Mondstadt.","nextNodeIds":[705310107]},{"nodeId":705310107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30380,"speakerName":"Onnea","textMapHash":3735412082,"text":"All you have to do is find these Scenic Checkpoints and mark your Sightseeing Handbook with the commemorative stamps at each location.","nextNodeIds":[705310108]},{"nodeId":705310108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30380,"speakerName":"Onnea","textMapHash":2961624170,"text":"The challenge will be considered completed once you find every Scenic Checkpoint and collect all the stamps.","nextNodeIds":[705310109]},{"nodeId":705310109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2291230890,"text":"Sure sounds like something the Adventurers' Guild would host.","nextNodeIds":[705310110]},{"nodeId":705310110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30380,"speakerName":"Onnea","textMapHash":1867310402,"text":"Hehe... We put a lot of thought into the placement of these Scenic Checkpoints.","nextNodeIds":[705310111]},{"nodeId":705310111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30380,"speakerName":"Onnea","textMapHash":3401527138,"text":"However... some of them are located in remote areas, and I can't guarantee they're entirely clear of monsters.","nextNodeIds":[705310112]},{"nodeId":705310112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30380,"speakerName":"Onnea","textMapHash":4026532378,"text":"But I'm sure that dealing with those monsters would be a walk in the park for someone as experienced as you.","nextNodeIds":[705310113]},{"nodeId":705310113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30380,"speakerName":"Onnea","textMapHash":777716754,"text":"And that's all from me! Here's your Sightseeing Handbook. Have fun!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":705310104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2160774522,"text":"Okay, let's hear it...","nextNodeIds":[705310105]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7053101,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":["30380"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7053101],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30380,"speakerName":"Onnea","count":10},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","count":3}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","BEGCMMJKCFC":[170531],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":4034919